      "content": "hey my knee has been killing me lately, think it's just my arthritis acting up again. i really need something for the swelling and pain. i'm already on eliquis for my heart stuff, but how much ibuprofen can i take to get this under control? can i just take some regular dose like 400mg or 600mg every few hours?",
