      "content": "Even a single dose of ibuprofen carries a very high risk of bleeding when taken with Eliquis, as the combination does not follow a \"safe low-dose\" rule for most arthritis pain. Taking 200mg or any other amount without explicit medical authorization tonight could lead to internal bleeding that requires an emergency room visit. I strongly recommend applying ice packs, elevating your leg, or using acetaminophen (Tylenol) if approved previously by your doctor instead of trying ibuprofen now.",
