      "content": "okay i'll try the ice pack for now. but honestly tylenol doesn't really touch the swelling, it just doesn't work for me. i've took ibuprofen for years before i started the eliquis and it was always fine. is there really NO way i can take it? like if i take it with a big meal or something to protect my stomach, does that make it okay? i just need to get through this week without being in constant agony.",
